  "description": "A geography quiz game where you identify all 50 U.S. states by their silhouettes.\n\nLearn state names and locations while paying close attention to each state’s unique shape.\n\nYou may think you know them, but some states are trickier than they look.\n\nTest your intuition, build your knowledge, and see how many you can get right.\n\nPerfect for geography fans, quiz lovers, and anyone who wants to learn while having fun.\n\nChallenge yourself and aim to master all 50 states.\n\nThe maps, place names, and regional classifications used in this software are for learning and quiz purposes only and do not imply any position or claim regarding sovereignty, territory, or boundaries.",
